<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech year EPS up 129 pct, prospects good.</title>
<headline>Advtech year EPS up 129 pct, prospects good.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  15.60	 vs 6.82</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 5.00	  vs 2.50</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   5.86	  vs 1.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   8.24	  vs 2.08</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.89	  vs 0.55</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.12	  vs 0.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		  48.38	 vs 22.06</p>
<p>Div payable on register June 20</p>
<p>Full name: Advanced Technical Systems Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said prospects for the current year were positive with the group positioned as a leading player in the private education sector following recent acquisitions. Further selective buys would continue.</p>
<p>Advtech said it planned to offer non-voting &quot;N&quot; capitalisation shares in lieu of the cash dividend. Details will be announced on June 16.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
